 one of the kindest souls in this planet plus she makes AMAZING food!! I have always loved her doubles. Go try them. They're ridiculous. I finally tried the fish sandwich from Chef Lisa over at and to no surprise, it was ridiculously good!!! Think crispy fried fish, sweet plantains, and slightly sweet coco (coconut) bread!"},{"business_id":"lC_-o39gjsV2-LaG4IfAIg","review_id":"rKsEQ0bZaFbx_5g01CIKGw","date":"2021-02-14T00:53:38","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9039949178695679,"text_excerpt":"Food is always delicious. Can't go wrong with anything on the menu. The fish is so flavorful. It's battered in cornmeal thankfully! The jerk chicken is wonderful is well. And the sorrel is amazing! I could drink it daily!!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"lC_-o39gjsV2-LaG4IfAIg","photo_id":"2bUfvEVMP227WjUbl-WruQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/2bUfvEVMP227WjUbl-WruQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0000001192092896}]},"notebook_case":null}
